Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] P6.1 gym fills 16:9

The gym (STGTRAIN: the party to train, the training list, the session and
the results) ran with gutter 0. port/options/widescreen.c gives the overlay
the menu gutter and:

- the scrolling background (96 px period) is drawn twice more, 96 pixels to
  each side, as patch 0053;
- the status, stats and TP panels that hang from the left edge are drawn one
  gutter further left (DW3_MENU_LEFT) with their windows, the partner
  sprite and their open pivots;
- the panels that run off the right edge (the party box, the training list,
  the message and session plates) are extended to the picture's edge
  (DW3_MENU_EXTEND) and their open pivots follow the 16:9 right edge.

Only drawing positions change. Off (gutter 0) every position is the PS1 one.

